WEBVTT

00:17.350 --> 00:18.670
Look here...

00:18.670 --> 00:22.170
Tell anyone in our class about us,
and I'll delete your existence.

00:22.700 --> 00:25.800
I got married to my classmate.
And...

00:26.510 --> 00:28.370
She's also the girl I hate most...

00:28.370 --> 00:30.800
...in the whole school.

00:31.050 --> 00:32.550
FOUR DAYS AGO

00:32.550 --> 00:36.180
You filled yesterday's class journal entry
with random stuff and left, huh!

00:36.180 --> 00:38.940
CLASS JOURNAL
What do you mean "nothing to comment on"?!

00:39.320 --> 00:41.940
Yesterday was a mundane day, after all.

00:41.940 --> 00:45.120
And "refer to timetable"
in the subject column?!

00:45.120 --> 00:46.940
There was no change to the timetable, too.

00:47.280 --> 00:49.060
You didn't even clean the blackboard!

00:49.060 --> 00:49.990
Also, "evil spirits"

00:49.990 --> 00:51.450
EVIL SPIRITS
in the absence students column?!

00:51.450 --> 00:53.700
Oh, come on!
No one would read that.

00:53.700 --> 00:54.920
I would! And I did!

00:54.920 --> 00:55.840
Free much?

00:55.840 --> 00:57.000
I'm not!

00:57.880 --> 00:58.870
What a drag...

00:58.870 --> 01:00.500
Say what now?!

01:00.500 --> 01:04.260
If you have time to bother me,
then just spend it on reading books.

01:04.260 --> 01:08.590
I'm not! I'm just trying to fix
your rotten character!

01:08.590 --> 01:12.590
Geez, cut him some slack, Akane!

01:12.590 --> 01:14.720
You're gonna make Saito cry.

01:14.720 --> 01:15.480
Himari...

01:15.480 --> 01:16.280
As if.

01:16.280 --> 01:17.700
He's the one at fault here.

01:17.700 --> 01:20.590
He's a negligent class duty carrier,
nay, a negligent human!

01:20.590 --> 01:21.350
No, I'm not!

01:21.890 --> 01:25.480
Akane, why do you always
pester Saito so much?

01:25.480 --> 01:26.740
Why?

01:27.180 --> 01:28.860
Why, you ask...

01:28.860 --> 01:30.740
I never thought of that.

01:30.740 --> 01:33.090
It simply irks me
whenever I see his face...

01:33.090 --> 01:35.370
Like, I wanna crush him with a slipper...

01:35.370 --> 01:37.990
So I'm mentally impossible to you, huh!
Why, thanks!

01:39.010 --> 01:42.500
Are you two bickering again?

01:42.500 --> 01:43.830
- Wow! Shisei!
- We're not.

01:43.830 --> 01:44.500
- So cute!
- I'm just being arbitrarily bullied.

01:44.500 --> 01:46.250
- I want to give her more snacks!
- I'm just being arbitrarily bullied.

01:46.870 --> 01:49.100
Oh, my cousin, you poor thing.

01:49.100 --> 01:51.020
There, there.

01:51.020 --> 01:53.760
Oh, my salvation and cousin Shisei...
Always so understanding...

01:53.760 --> 01:56.800
But if you pester him so much,

01:56.800 --> 01:59.670
does that mean you have
a crush on him?

01:59.670 --> 02:02.020
Huh?! Like hell!

02:02.020 --> 02:06.270
Even if Saito's the only guy in this world,
no way I'd fall for him like ever!

02:06.270 --> 02:07.550
Yeah, right back at you!

02:07.550 --> 02:10.400
Even if the world turns upside down,
I'd fall for anyone but you!

02:16.410 --> 02:17.470
GRANDFATHER (HOJO)

02:17.470 --> 02:18.530
GRANDFATHER (HOJO)
It's Grandpa...

02:20.020 --> 02:22.630
Saito, are you free now?

02:22.630 --> 02:23.750
Nah, I don't need to ask.

02:23.750 --> 02:25.500
Care for a cuppa now?

02:25.500 --> 02:28.470
Sorry, but I'm not into dates
with old geezers.

02:28.470 --> 02:29.920
Already booked one with my book.

02:30.260 --> 02:32.910
Oh, come on.
You can always read a book anytime.

02:32.910 --> 02:36.340
I'm planning to give
my company to you someday.

02:36.660 --> 02:39.930
You'd better humour me
for a bit here, or regret it.

02:40.310 --> 02:42.300
Long live our grandpater.

02:42.300 --> 02:44.470
Now that's cold, my grandson.

02:44.470 --> 02:46.590
You're hurting your grandpa here.

02:46.590 --> 02:49.190
I thought you'd be more mentally resilient.

02:49.480 --> 02:51.470
You know me well!

02:51.470 --> 02:53.480
And you, with your brilliant mind,

02:53.480 --> 02:57.200
should also know that you
can't disobey me, right?

02:59.070 --> 03:00.390
What happens if I run away?

03:00.390 --> 03:04.370
I'd obey my order without resisting
if I were you, for your own good.

03:04.370 --> 03:08.080
So exists a grandfather blackmailing
his grandson like some villain, huh?

03:08.400 --> 03:09.820
You're talking to one.

03:09.820 --> 03:12.340
Get in the car now.

03:14.390 --> 03:17.090
So, where am I being taken to?

03:17.460 --> 03:20.700
We were told to let you know
once we're there.

03:21.260 --> 03:23.100
I'm sorry about our selfish president.

03:23.560 --> 03:24.820
No need to be.

03:24.820 --> 03:25.760
I'm used to this.

03:26.490 --> 03:28.510
There was once a great
depression happening.

03:28.990 --> 03:32.960
The one who revived Hojo Group
from utter crisis...

03:32.960 --> 03:35.110
...was my grandfather, Tenryu Hojo.

03:35.650 --> 03:37.870
Despite public criticism,

03:37.870 --> 03:40.600
he mercilessly cut down
incompetent executives,

03:40.600 --> 03:44.620
and transformed Hojo Group
into a global high-tech company.

03:45.530 --> 03:48.480
He is over sixty years old
and is still a brilliant man,

03:48.480 --> 03:51.550
taking the lead in his own business.

03:52.390 --> 03:56.510
For what it's worth, our president
seems to be doting on you.

03:57.220 --> 03:58.850
Unlike your father.

04:04.770 --> 04:07.390
Hey, why are you here?!

04:07.810 --> 04:10.040
My grandpa summoned me here.

04:10.040 --> 04:10.900
What about you?

04:11.460 --> 04:13.660
My grandma called me here.

04:13.660 --> 04:15.530
Wait, what does it have to do with you?!

04:15.530 --> 04:17.990
You're the one who asked first.

04:19.990 --> 04:23.040
I was looking forward to
a fun lunch with my grandma,

04:23.040 --> 04:25.180
and you had to ruin my mood
with this coincidence.

04:25.180 --> 04:27.250
Agreed. Don't talk to me while I read.

04:27.250 --> 04:29.290
Huh?! I'm not!

04:29.290 --> 04:31.380
No business means no talking!

04:31.380 --> 04:33.190
Some attitude you have, huh.

04:33.190 --> 04:36.020
Apologise to me,
or I'll keep yapping forever!

04:36.020 --> 04:38.100
You gonna follow me until I say sorry?

04:38.100 --> 04:40.260
Yeah! I'll follow you everywhere!

04:40.260 --> 04:41.280
Man, you're such a pain!

04:41.280 --> 04:43.010
You mean your existence is?!

04:44.470 --> 04:45.440
Yo.

04:45.440 --> 04:48.180
Oh, my...
Already starting early, huh?

04:48.180 --> 04:50.390
Young'uns are so impatient.

04:50.720 --> 04:51.980
- Grandpa?
- Grandma?

04:52.910 --> 04:55.300
How long are you gonna sit there?

04:55.640 --> 04:58.150
Come with me, you two.

04:58.150 --> 04:59.930
"You two"?

04:59.930 --> 05:02.290
You mean Sakuramori and I?

05:07.160 --> 05:10.150
First, to celebrate this eventful day...

05:10.150 --> 05:11.470
Let's have a toast!

05:13.090 --> 05:14.170
Eventful?

05:14.610 --> 05:15.920
What does he mean?

05:18.280 --> 05:20.300
I'll have another glass, please.

05:20.300 --> 05:22.470
All you've been drinking is juice.

05:22.470 --> 05:27.100
I'm starving,
but I lost my appetite after seeing you.

05:27.100 --> 05:28.510
Same here.

05:28.510 --> 05:31.850
Are you letting out some sort of
chemical stuff that shrinks the stomach?

05:31.850 --> 05:34.020
All this delicious food...
What a waste.

05:34.020 --> 05:36.130
Would you just delete
your presence to the core?

05:36.130 --> 05:39.360
Why don't you disappear into
the quantum unit? That'd be quicker.

05:41.290 --> 05:43.860
Glad to see you two so close.

05:43.860 --> 05:44.620
We're not!

05:44.620 --> 05:47.700
They remind me of our young selves.

05:47.700 --> 05:48.960
- Yeah!
- So, what's the important stuff?

05:48.960 --> 05:50.370
- So, what's the important stuff?

05:51.050 --> 05:53.120
Why are we called here?

05:54.320 --> 05:56.000
Get married.

05:56.500 --> 05:57.230
Huh?

05:57.840 --> 06:01.890
Did I just hear "get married"?
Is that some kind of metaphor? A code?

06:01.890 --> 06:03.970
Have I just received
some kind of cypher?

06:03.970 --> 06:06.470
Hey, don't think of it too deeply.

06:06.470 --> 06:08.710
Get married? I don't get it...

06:08.710 --> 06:11.230
What do you mean?
We're still in high school...

06:11.230 --> 06:14.230
You can get married at eighteen.

06:14.230 --> 06:16.040
I'll say it once again.

06:16.040 --> 06:17.730
Get married.

06:19.300 --> 06:21.990
Chiyo and I have known
each other for so long.

06:22.770 --> 06:26.630
We had mutual feelings for
each other in our youth... I think.

06:27.070 --> 06:31.250
But we kept crossing paths without meeting,
and never got connected.

06:31.250 --> 06:36.490
I married my fiancee,
and successfully made her happy.

06:36.490 --> 06:39.140
It has been ten years
since she passed away.

06:39.140 --> 06:42.670
I think I have done my job
as her husband.

06:42.670 --> 06:45.790
My husband has long passed away too.

06:45.790 --> 06:49.010
Now, Tenryu is taking care of me
every night.

06:49.010 --> 06:51.020
Yeah, I don't wanna hear that!

06:51.320 --> 06:54.790
Thus, we have enjoyed life ourselves.

06:54.790 --> 06:59.020
Still, we'd end up wondering, "What if
we were bound by the threads of fate...

06:59.020 --> 07:01.030
...right from the start."

07:01.430 --> 07:04.930
Which is why we want our grandchildren
to fulfill the dream...

07:04.930 --> 07:07.160
...that we couldn't.

07:07.480 --> 07:08.840
Akane.

07:08.840 --> 07:13.290
You will get married for
your grandmother's sake, right?

07:13.290 --> 07:15.780
No! That's too selfish of you!

07:15.780 --> 07:18.520
Marriage is something you do
of your own volition!

07:18.520 --> 07:22.000
You fall in love with someone you like,
and they make a romantic proposal to you!

07:22.000 --> 07:24.320
It's not something you tell someone to do!

07:24.320 --> 07:25.080
What a maiden...

07:25.080 --> 07:26.680
Well, it's a matter of course!

07:27.150 --> 07:28.680
I don't want this either.

07:28.680 --> 07:30.930
We have no intention
on getting married.

07:31.300 --> 07:35.440
You cannot force someone against
their will to get married in this country.

07:39.150 --> 07:41.110
I knew you'd say that.

07:41.110 --> 07:45.750
You two really look like
the young version of us.

07:50.570 --> 07:54.110
Saito, if you really
don't want to marry her,

07:54.110 --> 07:56.720
that dog will inherit the company.

07:56.720 --> 07:57.500
Huh?

07:57.500 --> 07:59.560
It's just some dog I picked off the street.

07:59.560 --> 08:02.870
To be honest, I'm worried about
putting it on the top of the company.

08:02.870 --> 08:04.090
Well, that's a dog!

08:04.090 --> 08:05.930
But it can at least stamp some paper.

08:05.930 --> 08:08.720
Put some ink on its paw,
and you get a thumb print.

08:08.720 --> 08:10.340
Yeah, like that's the problem!

08:10.780 --> 08:12.240
You're right.

08:12.240 --> 08:15.980
Maybe Hojo Group will end
with my generation.

08:15.980 --> 08:17.390
Are you insane?

08:17.390 --> 08:21.400
You think you can run a company
without some insanity?

08:23.170 --> 08:25.590
Akane, come over here.

08:34.700 --> 08:36.140
Think about it.

08:36.600 --> 08:40.420
Look at the truth of how it is
really in your best interests,

08:40.750 --> 08:45.050
and not get caught up
in immediate emotions.

08:45.350 --> 08:46.430
You will answer...

08:47.030 --> 08:48.880
...within three days.

08:52.690 --> 08:54.770
What will you do?

08:55.690 --> 08:58.810
Are you... gonna marry me?

08:59.730 --> 09:01.310
What about you?

09:01.310 --> 09:05.090
Don't ask me!
I never thought this would happen!

09:05.460 --> 09:07.940
What did your grandma say to you?

09:09.270 --> 09:11.070
It doesn't concern you.

09:11.070 --> 09:14.350
I need to know
what the other party's hand is.

09:14.350 --> 09:18.390
No, you don't!
Don't try to peek inside my mind!

09:18.390 --> 09:19.670
Then suit yourself!

09:19.670 --> 09:22.830
Yes, I will! It's my own future!

09:28.840 --> 09:32.340
3RD 3-A SHISEI HOJO - 2ND AKANE SAKURAMORI
- 1ST 3-A SAITO HOJO

09:45.490 --> 09:47.770
Hello, Earth to Akane?

09:47.770 --> 09:49.700
Say...

09:49.700 --> 09:51.600
This is just hypothetically speaking...

09:52.050 --> 09:54.600
What would you do
if you were forced...

09:54.600 --> 09:58.130
...to marry someone you don't like
out of family circumstances?

09:58.130 --> 10:01.680
Wow, girl, that's so Jomon, y'know!

10:01.680 --> 10:05.740
Yeah, I thought so too.

10:06.140 --> 10:09.360
But, I guess I'd just turn it down.

10:09.360 --> 10:10.260
Why?

10:10.260 --> 10:13.990
HIMARI
I've got a crush, y'know.

10:13.990 --> 10:16.640
HIMARI
I only want to marry him.

10:16.640 --> 10:20.080
Wait, you had a crush?
I didn't know! Who?

10:20.080 --> 10:23.980
I never took you for someone
who'd be interested in such thing.

10:23.980 --> 10:26.980
I usually... wouldn't be.

10:27.310 --> 10:29.470
Nah, I'm still not telling who.

10:29.470 --> 10:32.110
Come on, spill the tea!
Is he from our class?

10:34.610 --> 10:38.480
Wh-What about you, Akane?
Got a crush on someone?

10:38.480 --> 10:41.080
There is someone
I wish he were dead now...

10:41.080 --> 10:44.220
Oh, yeah. Had he died, all my problems
would have been washed away.

10:44.220 --> 10:46.630
I hope a meteor falls on him.

10:46.630 --> 10:50.730
If you don't have a crush,
then I'd say you could marry the guy.

10:50.730 --> 10:53.250
Your rent and gas bills will be in half.

10:53.250 --> 10:56.010
If you cook in bulk,
it'll get cheaper in the long run!

10:56.010 --> 10:59.530
I don't think that's a valid reason
to get married...

10:59.530 --> 11:00.870
Besides...

11:00.870 --> 11:03.370
We gotta do it... right?

11:03.370 --> 11:04.650
Huh? Do what?

11:04.650 --> 11:08.170
You know, the stuff a boy
and a girl do together...

11:08.170 --> 11:10.550
Can't hear ya.

11:10.550 --> 11:12.530
I'm talking about sex!

11:12.530 --> 11:14.170
Well, duh.

11:14.170 --> 11:16.510
Your family's gotta be expecting
a new generation.

11:16.510 --> 11:18.280
Then, you could go for a hundred!

11:18.280 --> 11:19.310
Yeah, nah!

11:19.310 --> 11:21.870
Oh, you can do it!
Just have quintuplets twenty times!

11:21.870 --> 11:24.060
I'm not that tough a woman!

11:24.060 --> 11:25.290
Aren't we talking about you?

11:25.290 --> 11:27.880
No, we're not!

11:30.240 --> 11:32.760
Why her out of all girls...

11:32.760 --> 11:34.800
That Akane Sakuramori!

11:34.800 --> 11:37.310
Being pestered by her at school
is enough trouble already,

11:37.310 --> 11:41.600
and bickering with her at home
would be too much for my soul!

11:42.240 --> 11:43.270
But...

11:43.610 --> 11:46.020
Cousin, you seem to be deep in thoughts.

11:46.400 --> 11:49.030
Grandpa gave me an unreasonable demand.

11:49.580 --> 11:50.930
Unreasonable?

11:50.930 --> 11:55.190
If I want to inherit Hojo Group,
my life is in the palm of his hand.

11:55.190 --> 11:59.160
If I refuse, he'll just give the company
to some random dog.

11:59.580 --> 12:01.890
That's what he'd definitely say.

12:01.890 --> 12:03.180
Right?

12:03.970 --> 12:06.210
What do you want to do?

12:07.360 --> 12:09.380
Do you want to live a free life?

12:09.380 --> 12:11.270
Or do you want the company?

12:12.370 --> 12:13.960
I want both, if possible.

12:14.710 --> 12:16.470
That would be selfish.

12:17.500 --> 12:22.280
A living being cannot
live freely in the first place.

12:22.280 --> 12:26.040
All is bound by the rules called instincts.

12:27.110 --> 12:29.830
The world is full of rules.

12:29.830 --> 12:34.230
It is wisest to not run away from rules,
but use them in this world.

12:34.800 --> 12:36.300
So I should inherit the company?

12:36.860 --> 12:38.880
You don't have to.

12:38.880 --> 12:40.780
Even if you become poor,

12:40.780 --> 12:44.100
and must survive by rummaging the trash,

12:44.100 --> 12:46.920
I will do it together with you.

12:46.920 --> 12:49.250
You should just dump such useless guy.

12:50.690 --> 12:52.580
I know it all.

12:52.580 --> 12:55.340
In order for you to fulfil your dream,

12:55.340 --> 12:59.150
you need to use Grandpa's company.

12:59.530 --> 13:02.640
That's why I won't get in your way.

13:03.130 --> 13:06.830
Even if your life is full of thorny paths,

13:06.830 --> 13:09.740
I will always be on your side.

13:10.400 --> 13:12.140
You can rely on me.

13:13.520 --> 13:15.330
Thanks, Shisei.

13:17.650 --> 13:19.420
- You're so cute!
- Want some cookies?

13:19.420 --> 13:21.660
- We've got chocolates too.
- And then...

13:22.100 --> 13:22.660
Hey.

13:28.120 --> 13:30.120
THREE DAYS LATER

13:30.490 --> 13:31.760
So...

13:31.760 --> 13:33.250
Have you made up your minds?

13:33.700 --> 13:34.720
Yes.

13:34.720 --> 13:36.500
Let's hear it, then.

13:36.980 --> 13:39.910
Which life will you two choose?

13:39.910 --> 13:43.510
Will it the path of the fool, or the wise?

13:44.180 --> 13:45.260
I...

13:49.150 --> 13:50.450
I will get married.

13:55.400 --> 13:56.770
I'M GETTING MARRIED TO A GIRL

13:56.770 --> 13:58.360
I HATE IN MY CLASS

13:58.360 --> 14:01.360
I'M GETTING MARRIED TO A GIRL
I HATE IN THE CLASS

15:16.270 --> 15:20.980
I'M GETTING MARRIED TO A GIRL
I HATE IN THE CLASS

15:20.980 --> 15:21.500
#1 I GOT MARRIED TO A GIRL I HATE

15:21.500 --> 15:23.370
#1 I GOT MARRIED TO A GIRL I HATE
Huh? You sure?

15:23.370 --> 15:25.240
#1 I GOT MARRIED TO A GIRL I HATE
I-I have no choice!

15:25.740 --> 15:28.060
I'll marry you and anything!

15:28.060 --> 15:30.840
But it's not because I like you...

15:30.840 --> 15:32.240
That's not the reason, okay!

15:32.240 --> 15:33.940
Wonderful!

15:33.940 --> 15:35.860
Congrats, Akane.

15:35.860 --> 15:38.000
Now I can rest easy.

15:38.350 --> 15:40.240
Well, it's settled, then.

15:40.240 --> 15:43.880
I'll deal with the family register and ceremony
once I graduate from uni.

15:43.880 --> 15:45.510
What are you talking about?

15:46.070 --> 15:48.450
You are getting married now.

15:48.450 --> 15:50.640
I've already prepared
a new house for you.

15:51.070 --> 15:52.260
What?

15:53.230 --> 15:56.890
I built this fresh love nest just for you!

15:56.890 --> 15:59.700
At least let me go home first!

15:59.700 --> 16:01.650
All I'm carrying now
is only my school bag!

16:01.990 --> 16:05.060
All your stuff has already
been moved to your new home.

16:05.060 --> 16:07.400
It's no use running.

16:07.400 --> 16:10.780
I thought you'd be busy, so we already
sent out the marriage letter.

16:11.100 --> 16:13.160
The rest is up to you young'uns.

16:13.470 --> 16:15.910
- Take your time!
- Wait, Grandma!

16:15.910 --> 16:17.540
Don't leave me!

16:17.540 --> 16:19.790
Don't abandon me!

16:21.050 --> 16:23.180
Oh, well. We should get in.

16:25.410 --> 16:27.130
So our belongings are inside...

16:28.740 --> 16:30.780
Hey, why did you lock the door?!

16:30.780 --> 16:32.220
Well, you normally would, right?

16:32.220 --> 16:35.600
Are you trying to lock me in?!
Cut off my escape route?!

16:35.600 --> 16:38.350
You can unlock it anytime from inside!
Stop overthinking!

16:38.350 --> 16:40.300
Yeah, how about that!

16:43.980 --> 16:45.480
SAITO - AKANE

16:45.810 --> 16:47.280
These must be our belongings.

16:53.530 --> 16:55.850
Wow, look at this girl hyping.

16:55.850 --> 16:59.020
I'm not! It'd be super fun
to live here alone,

16:59.020 --> 17:01.460
but it's all ruined because you're here!

17:01.460 --> 17:04.460
I was looking forward to
my single life too!

17:05.020 --> 17:06.910
What's the switch for?

17:06.910 --> 17:08.840
For the lights and bubble bath, apparently.

17:10.470 --> 17:11.860
What's wrong with bubble bath?

17:11.860 --> 17:13.220
What about it?!

17:13.760 --> 17:15.720
So this is my private room...

17:16.230 --> 17:19.050
To think my study room
would be my sole solace...

17:19.050 --> 17:21.480
Wh-What the heck?!

17:22.280 --> 17:23.110
What's wrong?

17:23.110 --> 17:25.480
There's only one bed!

17:25.480 --> 17:27.550
What...

17:27.550 --> 17:28.990
That old geezer!

17:29.410 --> 17:32.110
Huh? There's only one bed?

17:32.110 --> 17:36.450
Well, it's one for two.
You two are married, after all.

17:36.450 --> 17:37.410
I can't!

17:37.410 --> 17:39.720
You will obey me
even if you can't do that.

17:39.720 --> 17:41.910
You are forbidden
from using the sofa or floor.

17:41.910 --> 17:44.660
You will sleep together
at night at all costs.

17:44.660 --> 17:46.920
This is the top priority condition.

17:46.920 --> 17:50.480
Good luck with your "group work"
with Saito.

17:50.480 --> 17:53.020
What do you mean "group work"?!

17:53.020 --> 17:54.720
A condition?

17:54.720 --> 17:55.930
Don't tell me...

17:55.930 --> 17:57.900
Are there cameras? Sensors?

17:57.900 --> 18:00.660
Something to let them know
we're sleeping together?!

18:01.670 --> 18:03.440
It's all yes?!

18:03.850 --> 18:05.110
Are we doing it?

18:05.110 --> 18:06.250
Huh?

18:06.250 --> 18:07.950
We're doing it, right?

18:07.950 --> 18:09.190
Do what?

18:09.190 --> 18:12.690
Even though I cry and weep,
you'll just do me until you're happy, right?!

18:12.690 --> 18:14.820
So much that I won't make it
to school tomorrow!

18:14.820 --> 18:16.200
What are you talking about?!

18:16.200 --> 18:18.070
I'm talking about sex, of course!

18:18.070 --> 18:22.080
You think I didn't notice you
gawking at my body earlier?!

18:22.080 --> 18:23.460
Yeah, it's just you!

18:23.460 --> 18:24.530
I'm aware of it!

18:24.530 --> 18:27.000
At times like this,
the only thing on a boy's mind...

18:27.000 --> 18:28.590
...will be lecherous thoughts!

18:28.590 --> 18:31.090
I won't let you have your way!

18:31.400 --> 18:32.590
C-Calm down!

18:32.590 --> 18:36.090
I'm not one to forcefully do such thing!

18:41.600 --> 18:42.930
Want me to carry that?

18:42.930 --> 18:46.360
That's how you enter my room
and do funny stuff to me, huh!

18:46.740 --> 18:49.110
Then suit yourself.
Don't drop the box.

18:49.110 --> 18:50.860
I'm not that stu—

18:50.860 --> 18:51.830
Look out!

18:52.720 --> 18:54.450
Thank...

18:54.450 --> 18:55.610
Forget it!

18:55.940 --> 19:00.530
If you die on the first day of our wedding,
I'll be framed as the murderer.

19:00.530 --> 19:04.620
That one didn't count!
The me from now won't be that stupid!

19:04.620 --> 19:05.950
I BET YOU WON'T HAVE TIME TO DO HOUSEWORK
ON YOUR FIRST DAY, SO EAT THIS - TENRYU

19:05.950 --> 19:08.380
This annoys me,
but he sure is considerate.

19:14.580 --> 19:15.790
Want to eat together.

19:15.790 --> 19:17.890
As if I'd do something
a married couple would!

19:17.890 --> 19:20.760
Even if we're not a couple,
we could at least eat together.

19:20.760 --> 19:24.350
So you'll eat me even if we're not married?!
You're gonna peel me off and strip me?!

19:24.350 --> 19:25.810
Man, you broke your ears or what?!

19:26.140 --> 19:28.310
Just eat, or you'll die from starvation.

19:30.190 --> 19:32.820
What are you,
a stray cat wary of people?!

19:41.270 --> 19:42.700
I'm beat...

19:46.570 --> 19:48.830
E-Excuse me...

19:48.830 --> 19:50.030
O-Oh...

19:52.860 --> 19:54.840
Th-This is cramped...

19:54.840 --> 19:58.220
He must've bought
the small bed on purpose.

19:58.540 --> 20:00.730
I can feel the warmth in my back...

20:00.730 --> 20:02.630
The smell of her shampoo after a bath...

20:02.630 --> 20:03.970
The sweet scent...

20:04.820 --> 20:06.480
This is bad!

20:06.910 --> 20:10.320
Try anything funny, and I'll be mad, okay?

20:10.320 --> 20:11.610
I know.

20:11.930 --> 20:14.750
You absolutely can't, okay?

20:14.750 --> 20:17.960
I've never done anything
lecherous before,

20:17.960 --> 20:19.870
and I've never had a boyfriend...

20:19.870 --> 20:22.410
Don't worry, me neither.

20:22.410 --> 20:24.770
I guess we'll be okay, then?

20:24.770 --> 20:26.120
About what?

20:26.810 --> 20:29.510
Why did you get married with me?

20:29.510 --> 20:30.890
I'm not telling.

20:30.890 --> 20:32.770
But I told you.

20:32.770 --> 20:34.850
I didn't ask.

20:34.850 --> 20:36.630
Well, no...

20:36.950 --> 20:40.140
Anyway, our marriage
is only a formality, okay?

20:40.140 --> 20:42.650
But I gotta keep my promise.

20:42.650 --> 20:45.270
I'm seriously against this,
but I just have to do my best.

20:45.680 --> 20:50.100
I'll endure anything for my dream.

20:50.100 --> 20:51.050
Dream?

20:52.520 --> 20:56.530
But, what if he adds
"having a child" as a condition?

20:56.840 --> 20:59.110
A-A child?! That's...

20:59.110 --> 21:00.990
Wow, it's so soft!

21:00.990 --> 21:04.370
Y-You just touched my butt, right?!
I'll break your fingers?!

21:04.370 --> 21:06.150
It's too cramped here,
for Pete's sake!

21:06.150 --> 21:10.120
Also, you're the one who butted in!

21:10.120 --> 21:12.130
PRESENT TIME...

21:12.840 --> 21:13.880
Look here...

21:13.880 --> 21:17.130
Tell anyone in our class about us,
and I'll delete your existence.

21:17.130 --> 21:19.080
Don't kill someone out of such trivial thing.

21:19.080 --> 21:20.430
It's not trivial!

21:20.430 --> 21:23.760
If anyone knows we're married,
I have no choice but to die!

21:23.760 --> 21:25.760
My social lifeline will be gone!

21:25.760 --> 21:27.640
How much do you hate me?!

21:28.040 --> 21:30.760
I don't want people to know either,
so I won't tell.

21:30.760 --> 21:32.150
I can't believe you.

21:32.150 --> 21:35.900
You're gonna tell the whole school
that we sleep together every night, right?

21:35.900 --> 21:36.730
No.

21:37.020 --> 21:39.030
Then, you'll tell the whole world...

21:39.030 --> 21:42.200
Nope. I'll keep the secret on my life.

21:42.860 --> 21:45.320
All right, I believe you.

21:45.320 --> 21:46.740
Glad to hear that...

21:47.160 --> 21:49.450
I got married to my classmate.

21:49.450 --> 21:52.120
In exchange, I'll install a voice
recorder on your person!

21:52.120 --> 21:56.170
If you talk about our marriage for one letter,
it'll explode with a radius of 1 kilometre!

21:56.170 --> 21:58.090
O ye of little faith, huh!

21:59.690 --> 22:01.660
She's also the girl I hate most...

22:02.180 --> 22:04.460
...in the whole school.

23:35.020 --> 23:40.980
#2 NEW LIFE
